{
  "title": "Find Rising-Star Marketing Executives at Fortune 100-500 Companies",
  "content": "This plan searches for 8-10 high-potential VP/SVP-level marketing executives at Fortune 100-500 companies who could be ready for CMO/Head of Marketing roles. We split the search across multiple parallel tracks covering different industry sectors and company segments, then use a people search tool for targeted executive discovery, and finally synthesize all findings into a curated list.\n\nApproach:\n1. First, get the current Fortune 100-500 company list to identify target companies\n2. Run parallel people searches and web research across different company segments to find VP/SVP marketing executives\n3. Synthesize all findings into a final ranked list of 8-10 candidates with profiles and rationale",
