    {
      "goal": "Search for VP and SVP level marketing executives at Fortune 100-250 companies. Look for rising stars with strong track records who could be ready for CMO roles. Find names, current titles, companies, and any notable achievements. Target companies like Target, Coca-Cola, PepsiCo, Procter & Gamble, Johnson & Johnson, Nike, Intel, Cisco, Honeywell, Caterpillar, Deere, General Mills, Colgate-Palmolive, Kraft Heinz, Mondelez, etc.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Search for VP and SVP level marketing executives at Fortune 250-400 companies. Look for rising stars with strong track records who could be ready for CMO roles. Find names, current titles, companies, and any notable achievements. Target companies like Hershey, Campbell Soup, Clorox, Hasbro, VF Corporation, Tapestry, Ralph Lauren, Under Armour, Levi Strauss, Church & Dwight, Edgewell, Spectrum Brands, Scotts Miracle-Gro, etc.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Search for VP and SVP level marketing executives at Fortune 400-500 companies and also search broadly for 'rising star marketing executive VP SVP Fortune 500' and 'top marketing leaders to watch VP SVP 2025 2026'. Look for people featured in industry lists like AdAge, Forbes CMO Next, Brand Innovators, ANA lists. Find names, current titles, companies, and notable achievements.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Use people_search to find marketing executives with titles VP Marketing, SVP Marketing, Vice President of Marketing, Senior Vice President of Marketing at large US corporations. Search for profiles that indicate Fortune 500 company experience and leadership trajectory toward CMO roles. Run multiple searches with different query variations to maximize coverage.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
